OL,3,GNEWSACable thieves strike again near M1
OL,4,Amotorway
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have struck again in a county
OL,7,Fsuffering from a spate of cable thefts.
OL,9,FThe latest incident happened in
OL,10,FSteppingley, close to the M1 near
OL,11,FFlitwick, Bedfordshire, between 01:00
OL,12,Fand 04:00 GMT on Wednesday.
OL,14,FIt follows incidents in Wilstead on 12
OL,15,FNovember, and two separate thefts in
OL,16,FLuton Road, near Toddington, on 5 and
OL,17,F11 November.
OL,19,FOfficers appealed to anyone who was
OL,20,Fdiverted from the M1 early on Wednesday
OL,21,Fto check dashcam footage for "anything
OL,22,Funusual".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
